## Diagnosis (this checkout)

1. `NewSessionDialog` Name = `<input data-testid="new-session-title">` initial `"Session"`. No Day field. `createSession` can send `dayLabel` but the dialog never does → backend `day_label = req.dayLabel or session_date`.
2. `EditSessionDialog` edits title / Block / Week only. Header (`App.tsx`) is prominent **Name** + **Week n** + **Block n** (`formatPlanLabel`). `dayLabel` is unused on web (Telegram still shows `dayLabel • date`).
3. `uniquePlanLabels` exists for Block/Week. **`uniquePlanTitles` does not exist.**
4. `getRecentBlock` is athlete-scoped but **New session does not prefill it** (copy paste does). No `al_recent_day` / `al_recent_name` / `al_recent_week`.
5. `LabelCombo` = native `<select>` + “Add new…”. User asked for easy mouse/keyboard pick: **ComboBox**, not that select, not a native Day `<select>`.

