## Product verdict

| Keep | Drop |
| :--- | :--- |
| Existing `Workout.dayLabel` | New column, title-prefix encoding, migration of ISO dayLabels |
| Date as calendar `YYYY-MM-DD` | Day = date, Day = Mon–Sun, required week containers |
| Name = `title` (freeform) | Default visible title `"Session"` |
| Day 1–7 presets + custom slot | Inventing `day_sequence` for this PR |
| Athlete-scoped `al_recent_*` | Global last-Day / last-Name |
| Copy dest click = date D1 (offset) | Relabeling copy-grain D1 as session Day |
| Sheets Date + Day + Title | Sheets as editable store |
| Optional Day (unlabeled OK) | Required Day on every session |
| ComboBox for Day **and** Name | Skinny native `<select>` for Day/Name; a second Name text field plus a Day select that cannot type |

